  "pseudocode": "1: i = 0, j = 0\n2: while j < typed.length\n3:   if i < name.length and name[i] == typed[j]\n4:     i++, j++\n5:   else if j > 0 and typed[j] == typed[j-1]\n6:     j++\n7:   else return false\n8: return i == name.length",
